  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two identical spherical balls of mass <math><mi>M</mi></math> and radius <math><mi>R</mi></math> each are stuck on two ends of a rod of length <math><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></math> and mass <math><mi>M</mi></math>(see figure). The moment of inertia of the system about the axis passing perpendicularly through the centre of the rod is</p><p><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/411f611a-a60d-4c7d-b64c-8930670382de-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 154px;\" /></p>",
